    <string name="preferences_debanding_summary">Apply GLSL shader to reduce color banding in video (re-connect required). Debanding forfeits the direct decoder-to-display path and adds one GPU copy, increasing latency.</string>
    <string name="preferences_debanding_render_when_dirty_title">Render only on new frame</string>
    <string name="preferences_debanding_render_when_dirty_summary">Redraw the debanding shader only when a new decoded frame arrives instead of every display refresh, reducing GPU load and power use.</string>
